The '''Leviathan''' is a colossal underwater boss that rules over the Devouring Depths of the Arcadian Sea. It is one of the seven Major [[World Bosses]], and spawns three times a week at 14:00 o'clock server time on Monday, Wednesday and Saturday.

== Preparation ==
In order to fight the Leviathan you are going to need to prepare some special items first. 
* Bring around 10 Warships equipped with epic+ {{Item|ItemID=30274|grade=Epic}}, legendary+ {{Item|ItemID=35138|grade=Legendary}} or {{Item|ItemID=35137|grade=Legendary}}, and both {{Item|ItemID=35141|grade=Divine}} and {{Item|ItemID=35140|grade=Divine}}. 
* Optional: Bring {{Item|ItemID=28891|grade=Heroic}} or {{Item|ItemID=28901|grade=Heroic}} to slow it down in critical phases. 
{{Div|{{RecipeBox|7152}}|{{RecipeBox|7136}}|{{RecipeBox|7133}}|{{RecipeBox|7139}}|{{RecipeBox|7138}}}}

== The fight ==
The fight takes place in the water. Everyone fights using the ships cannons, since the Leviathan is imune to any damage but Siege Damage. Every cannon has its own part in the fight and only by using them right one will be able to kill the Leviathan.

* '''DPS Cannons.''' {{Item|ItemID=35138|grade=Legendary}} has a short range with high damage and {{Item|ItemID=35137|grade=Legendary}} has longer range and a shorter cooldown but less damage.
* '''Chain-Shot Cannons.''' {{Item|ItemID=35141|grade=Divine}} are used for the even phases in which the Leviathan is moving and are used to attach slow stacks to it.
** {{BuffLink|14290}}
* '''High-Speed Siege Cannons.''' {{Item|ItemID=35140|grade=Divine}} are used to stun the Leviathan in his area phases, where it swims between ships on a spot. Timing it is right espeacially in the last phase.
** {{BuffLink|14610}}{{BuffLink|14612}}{{BuffLink|14611}}
* '''Adds.''' The Leviathan spawns Seabugs. A lot of Seabugs. Crowd Controling and killing them fast is crucial for the crew not to get killed by them.
* '''Wing attack.''' Getting too close to the wings pushes you away and deals damage.
* '''Pull.''' The Leviathan with suck in players in a certain area around it once it hits a certain phase..
* '''Healing.''' The Leviathan has a constant regeneration durin his moving phases and none in the tank phases.
*
* '''Leviathan's Authority.''' The Leviathan will only fight in its area, weaken anyone being inflicted with Trauma and will shove away anything in its way ({{BuffLink|11461}}).
* '''Leviathan's Fury.''' The Levathan summons Storms lifting ships off the ocean and throwing them around like toys ({{BuffLink|13840}}).
* '''Leviathan's Fear.''' Mounts and Pets near the Leviathan get the {{BuffLink|14596}} Debuff.
